~~END~~



-- Test cases for sp_xml_preparedocument with different data types and namespaces
-- Testing TEXT, NTEXT, CHAR, NCHAR, VARCHAR, NVARCHAR, XML and UDTs with namespace parameter
-- Test 1: XML datatype variable
